  ('calc-integration/ftc-part-1-statement', 'calc-integration', 14, 'FTC Part 1: $f$ is continuous on $[a, b]$ and $g(x) = \int_a^x f(t)\,dt$. Then $g''(x) = \,?$', '$f(x)$

