  ('calc-integration/ftc-sqrt-definite', 'calc-integration', 18, 'Evaluate $\int_1^4 \sqrt{x}\,dx$.', '$\frac{14}{3}$

Write $\sqrt{x} = x^{1/2}$, with antiderivative $\frac23 x^{3/2}$. Then $\frac23(4^{3/2} - 1^{3/2}) = \frac23(8 - 1) = \frac{14}{3}$.

