  ('calc-series/integral-test-remainder-bounds', 'calc-series', 30, 'Integral Test remainder: for $f$ positive, continuous and decreasing, what bounds does $R_n = S - S_n$ satisfy?', '$\int_{n+1}^{\infty} f(x)\,dx \le R_n \le \int_n^{\infty} f(x)\,dx$

