Tip: the upper bound is the quick one for error estimates.', null, '{}'::text[], null, 'integral test remainder estimate bounds R_n'),
  ('calc-series/integral-test-remainder-example', 'calc-series', 31, 'Using $S_{10}$ for $\sum \frac{1}{n^2}$, what upper bound does the integral test give for the error $R_{10}$?', '$\frac{1}{10}$

$R_{10} \le \int_{10}^{\infty} \frac{dx}{x^2} = \frac{1}{10}$. The lower bound is $\int_{11}^{\infty} \frac{dx}{x^2} = \frac{1}{11}$.

