  ('calc-series/direct-comparison-test', 'calc-series', 33, 'Direct Comparison: $0 \le a_n \le b_n$ for all $n$ and $\sum b_n$ converges. What can you conclude about $\sum a_n$?', '$\sum a_n$ **converges** (smaller than a convergent series)

If instead $\sum a_n$ diverges, then $\sum b_n$ diverges too. A series smaller than a divergent one, or bigger than a convergent one, proves nothing.

