Tip: to prove convergence, compare with a larger convergent series. Dropping a positive term from a denominator always enlarges the fraction.', 'converges', array['converge', 'convergent', 'it converges']::text[], null, 'comparison test n/(n^3+1) converges'),
  ('calc-series/comparison-ln-n-over-n', 'calc-series', 38, 'Does $\sum_{n=3}^{\infty} \frac{\ln n}{n}$ converge or diverge?', 'Diverges

