  ('calc-series/alternating-series-test', 'calc-series', 42, 'Alternating Series Test: $\sum (-1)^{n-1} b_n$ with $b_n > 0$ converges if which two conditions hold?', '$b_{n+1} \le b_n$ (decreasing, at least eventually) and $\lim b_n = 0$

