  ('calc-series/alternating-series-error', 'calc-series', 43, 'Using $S_4$ to approximate $\sum_{n=1}^{\infty} \frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n^2}$, what error bound does the Alternating Series Estimation Theorem give?', '$\frac{1}{25}$

