  ('calc-series/alternating-series-terms-needed', 'calc-series', 48, 'Fewest terms $n$ guaranteeing $|S - S_n| < 0.001$ for $\sum_{n=1}^{\infty} \frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n^2}$?', '$n = 31$

