  ('calc-series/alternating-p-series-regions', 'calc-series', 53, 'For $\sum \frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n^p}$, for which $p$ is it absolutely convergent, conditionally convergent, or divergent?', 'Absolute for $p > 1$, conditional for $0 < p \le 1$, divergent for $p \le 0$

