  ('calc-series/ratio-test', 'calc-series', 54, 'Ratio Test on $\sum \frac{2^n}{n!}$: what is $L = \lim \left|\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}\right|$?', '$L = 0$, so the series converges absolutely

