  ('calc-series/ratio-test-n-over-2-to-n', 'calc-series', 55, 'Ratio Test on $\sum \frac{n}{2^n}$: what is $L = \lim \left|\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}\right|$?', '$L = \frac12$, so the series converges absolutely

