  ('calc-series/root-test-n-over-2n-plus-1', 'calc-series', 59, 'Root Test on $\sum \left(\frac{n}{2n + 1}\right)^n$: what is $L = \lim \sqrt[n]{|a_n|}$?', '$L = \frac12$, so the series converges absolutely

