  ('calc-series/series-test-strategy', 'calc-series', 62, 'Which test do you try first for a series with factorials or exponentials, and which for a rational function of $n$?', 'Ratio Test for factorials and exponentials. Comparison or Limit Comparison for rational functions of $n$

