  ('calc-series/power-series-convergence-patterns', 'calc-series', 64, 'For a power series $\sum c_n (x - a)^n$, what are the three possible convergence patterns?', 'Only at $x = a$ ($R = 0$), for all $x$ ($R = \infty$), or on an interval of radius $R$ about $a$

