  ('trig-unit-circle/coterminal-23pi-over-4', 'trig-unit-circle', 89, 'Find the angle in $[0, 2\pi)$ that is coterminal with $\frac{23\pi}{4}$. Answer in radians.', '$\dfrac{7\pi}{4}$

