  ('diffeq-first-order/linear-argument-substitution', 'diffeq-first-order', 57, 'Substitution for $y'' = f(ax + by + c)$ with $b \ne 0$?', 'Let $u = ax + by + c$, so $u'' = a + b\,f(u)$, which is separable.

