  ('diffeq-first-order/nonuniqueness-example', 'diffeq-first-order', 59, '$y'' = 3y^{2/3}$, $y(0) = 0$ has the solution $y = 0$. Name a second solution. (type $y$ in $x$)', '$y = x^3$

