  ('diffeq-first-order/abs-y-unique', 'diffeq-first-order', 62, '$f(y) = |y|$ has no derivative at $0$. Does $y'' = |y|$, $y(0)=0$ still have a unique solution?', 'Yes, only $y = 0$.

