  ('diffeq-first-order/peano-existence', 'diffeq-first-order', 63, 'What does continuity of $f(x,y)$ alone guarantee for $y'' = f(x,y)$, $y(x_0)=y_0$?', 'At least one solution exists on some interval around $x_0$ (Peano''s theorem), but uniqueness is not guaranteed.

