  ('diffeq-first-order/equilibrium-definition', 'diffeq-first-order', 70, 'What is an **equilibrium** solution of $y'' = f(y)$, and how do you find it?', 'A constant solution $y \equiv y^*$, found by solving $f(y^*) = 0$.

