  ('diffeq-first-order/stability-derivative-test', 'diffeq-first-order', 72, 'Linearization test for stability of an equilibrium $y^*$ of $y'' = f(y)$?', 'If $f''(y^*) < 0$, it is **stable**. If $f''(y^*) > 0$, it is **unstable**.

