  ('diffeq-first-order/cooling-find-k', 'diffeq-first-order', 81, 'Coffee at $90\,^\circ\mathrm{C}$ in a $20\,^\circ\mathrm{C}$ room cools to $60\,^\circ\mathrm{C}$ in 10 min. Find $k$ in $\mathrm{min^{-1}}$ (3 decimals).', '$0.056$

