  ('diffeq-first-order/logistic-solution', 'diffeq-first-order', 86, 'Solution of the logistic equation $P'' = rP(1 - P/K)$ with $P(0) = P_0$?', '$P(t) = \dfrac{K}{1 + \left(\dfrac{K}{P_0} - 1\right)e^{-rt}}$

