  ('diffeq-first-order/mixing-tank-model', 'diffeq-first-order', 88, 'Setup for a **mixing tank** problem: how do you write $x''(t)$ for the amount of solute?', '$x'' = (\text{rate in}) - (\text{rate out})$, where rate out $= \dfrac{x}{V}\times(\text{outflow rate})$.

