  ('diffeq-first-order/mixing-tank-limit', 'diffeq-first-order', 89, 'Tank: $x'' = 1 - \dfrac{x}{50}$ ($x$ in kg), $x(0) = 0$. Find $\lim_{t\to\infty} x$ in kg. (number)', '50

