  ('diffeq-first-order/mixing-tank-changing-volume', 'diffeq-first-order', 90, 'In a mixing problem, what changes if inflow rate $\ne$ outflow rate?', 'The volume varies: $V(t) = V_0 + (r_{in} - r_{out})t$, and the outflow term is $\dfrac{x}{V(t)}\,r_{out}$.

