  ('diffeq-first-order/rc-circuit-model', 'diffeq-first-order', 91, 'ODE for the charge $q(t)$ on a capacitor in a series $RC$ circuit with constant source $E$?', '$R\,q'' + \dfrac{q}{C} = E$

