  ('diffeq-first-order/euler-method-formula', 'diffeq-first-order', 94, '**Euler''s method** update for $y'' = f(x,y)$ with step $h$?', '$y_{n+1} = y_n + h\,f(x_n, y_n)$, with $x_{n+1} = x_n + h$.

