  ('sw-data-structures/amortized-vs-average', 'sw-data-structures', 29, 'How does an amortized bound differ from an average-case bound?', 'Amortized: the worst-case total cost of any sequence of $k$ operations, divided by $k$. Average-case: an expectation over some distribution of inputs.

