  ('sw-data-structures/row-major-offset', 'sw-data-structures', 30, 'A 2D array with $R$ rows and $C$ columns is stored in row-major order. At what offset (in elements) from the start is element $[i][j]$, 0-indexed?', '$iC + j$

Row-major order (C, and NumPy by default) stores each row contiguously: skip $i$ full rows of $C$ elements, then $j$ more.

