  ('sw-data-structures/list-vs-set-membership', 'sw-data-structures', 32, 'Average time of `x in items` when `items` is a Python `list` vs a `set` of $n$ elements?', 'List: $O(n)$, a linear scan. Set: $O(1)$ on average, a hash lookup.

