  ('sw-data-structures/dynamic-array-shrink-quarter', 'sw-data-structures', 34, 'A dynamic array doubles when full. Why should it halve its capacity only when it falls to $1/4$ full, not $1/2$ full?', 'Shrinking at half full lets a sequence alternate one push and one pop right at the boundary, forcing a $\Theta(n)$ copy on every operation.

