  ('sw-data-structures/array-cache-locality', 'sw-data-structures', 35, 'Summing an array and summing a linked list are both $O(n)$. Why is the array usually much faster in practice?', 'Cache locality: array elements are contiguous, so each cache line fetched brings several neighbors along.

