  ('sw-data-structures/sorted-array-tradeoff', 'sw-data-structures', 36, 'Sorted array of $n$ keys: worst-case time to search for a key, and to insert a new one?', 'Search: $O(\log n)$ by binary search. Insert: $O(n)$.

