  ('sw-data-structures/postfix-evaluation', 'sw-data-structures', 45, 'Evaluate the postfix (reverse Polish) expression `3 4 + 2 *` with a stack.', '$14$

Push $3$ and $4$; `+` pops both and pushes $7$; push $2$; `*` pops $7$ and $2$ and pushes $14$.

