  ('sw-data-structures/queue-two-stacks', 'sw-data-structures', 46, 'A queue built from two stacks (push onto an inbox; pop from an outbox, refilling it from the inbox only when empty): amortized time per operation?', '$O(1)$ amortized.

One dequeue can cost $O(n)$ when it moves the whole inbox to the outbox.

