  ('sw-data-structures/circular-buffer-next-index', 'sw-data-structures', 47, 'In a circular buffer (ring buffer) with capacity $C$ and 0-indexed slots, which index comes after index $i$?', '$(i + 1) \bmod C$

The index wraps from $C - 1$ back to $0$.

