  ('sw-data-structures/equals-hashcode', 'sw-data-structures', 54, 'Two Java objects are equal by `equals()` but return different `hashCode()` values. What goes wrong when they''re used as `HashMap` keys?', 'Lookups miss: `HashMap` compares hash codes before calling `equals`.

