  ('sw-data-structures/catalan-bst-count', 'sw-data-structures', 66, 'How many structurally different BSTs can hold the three keys $1, 2, 3$?', '$5$

Try each key as the root: root $1$ or root $3$ leaves the other two keys on one side ($2$ shapes each), and root $2$ gives $1$ shape.

