Tip: always match $\lambda$ to the interval in the question.', '3', array['three']::text[], null, 'Poisson rate rescale to interval length'),
  ('stats-distributions/poisson-sum', 'stats-distributions', 43, '$X \sim \text{Poisson}(2)$ and $Y \sim \text{Poisson}(3)$ are independent. $X + Y$ is Poisson with what mean?', '5

