  ('stats-distributions/exponential-cdf-worked', 'stats-distributions', 54, 'Waiting times are exponential with rate $\lambda = 0.5$ per minute. What is the probability you wait at most $3\,\mathrm{min}$? Round to 4 decimal places.', '0.7769

