  ('stats-distributions/exponential-median', 'stats-distributions', 55, 'Repair times are exponential with mean $10\,\mathrm{min}$. What is the median repair time, in minutes? Round to 2 decimal places.', '$10\ln 2 \approx 6.93\,\mathrm{min}$

