  ('stats-distributions/exponential-memoryless-worked', 'stats-distributions', 56, 'Waits at a help desk are exponential with mean $5\,\mathrm{min}$. You''ve already waited $3\,\mathrm{min}$. What is your expected additional wait, in minutes?', '$5\,\mathrm{min}$

