  ('stats-distributions/normal-inflection-points', 'stats-distributions', 58, 'Where are the inflection points of a normal density curve with mean $\mu$ and standard deviation $\sigma$?', 'At $x = \mu - \sigma$ and $x = \mu + \sigma$

