  ('stats-distributions/normal-pdf-formula', 'stats-distributions', 59, 'Write the density of the normal distribution with mean $\mu$ and standard deviation $\sigma$.', '$f(x) = \dfrac{1}{\sigma\sqrt{2\pi}}\, e^{-(x-\mu)^2/(2\sigma^2)}$

