  ('stats-distributions/normal-right-tail', 'stats-distributions', 63, 'Battery lifetimes are normal with mean $500\,\mathrm{h}$ and SD $40\,\mathrm{h}$. What proportion last more than $560\,\mathrm{h}$? Round to 4 decimal places.', '0.0668

