  ('stats-distributions/normal-between', 'stats-distributions', 64, 'Systolic blood pressures are normal with mean $120\,\mathrm{mmHg}$ and SD $16\,\mathrm{mmHg}$. What proportion lie between $112$ and $136\,\mathrm{mmHg}$? Round to 4 decimal places.', '0.5328

