  ('stats-distributions/normal-difference', 'stats-distributions', 68, 'Independent $X$ and $Y$ are normal: $X$ has mean $60$ and SD $8$; $Y$ has mean $50$ and SD $6$. What is $P(X > Y)$? Round to 4 decimal places.', '0.8413

