  ('stats-distributions/normal-approx-binomial', 'stats-distributions', 71, 'A fair coin is flipped $100$ times. Using the normal approximation with continuity correction, what is $P(\text{at least 60 heads})$? Round to 4 decimal places.', '0.0287

