  ('stats-distributions/se-difference-of-means', 'stats-distributions', 85, 'Independent samples: $\sigma_1 = 6$, $n_1 = 36$ and $\sigma_2 = 8$, $n_2 = 16$. What is the SD of $\bar{x}_1 - \bar{x}_2$? Round to 3 decimal places.', '$\sqrt{5} \approx 2.236$

