  ('stats-distributions/chi-square-construction', 'stats-distributions', 90, 'How is a chi-square random variable with $k$ degrees of freedom built from standard normals?', 'As a sum of squares, $Z_1^2 + Z_2^2 + \cdots + Z_k^2$, of $k$ independent standard normals.

